	"system": {
		"description": "<p>You attempt to interrupt a creature in the process of manifesting a psychic power, redirecting it at a target of your choosing. The power’s level must be less than your power rating. Make a manifesting ability check (DC 10 + the power’s level). On a success, you can choose a new target for the creature’s power within the power’s range. If the creature spent any surge points to manifest its power, you must spend an equivalent number of points to reflect it, otherwise this power fails.</p>",
